{"4792470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Werewolf - The Village", "steam_appid": 4792470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4800060], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WEREWOLF - THE VILLAGE is a multiplayer social deduction horror game where a group of adventurers must help a struggling village survive while trying to uncover which one of them is a Werewolf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work for the community during the day, survive the night, and discover who is hiding the curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PROFESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a Lumberjack, Miner, Hunter, or Herbalist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class has unique tasks, abilities, and responsibilities. The village's survival depends on everyone's cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/5ddb4d86d51afa690bc8a06bf4049638.poster.avif?t=1783425363\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/5ddb4d86d51afa690bc8a06bf4049638.webm?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/5ddb4d86d51afa690bc8a06bf4049638.mp4?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEEP THE VILLAGE ALIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, deliver supplies, and prevent the community from collapsing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shortage of food, coal, wood, or herbs will affect every player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/20d564c46bd3f4ee876cb910792e67a4.poster.avif?t=1783425363\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/20d564c46bd3f4ee876cb910792e67a4.webm?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/20d564c46bd3f4ee876cb910792e67a4.mp4?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNMASK THE WEREWOLF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the Mayor's death, the villagers must find the one responsible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attend meetings, accuse suspects, and survive long enough to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/ac41161569ce4a44b3b11f5d5f9287cf.poster.avif?t=1783425363\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/ac41161569ce4a44b3b11f5d5f9287cf.webm?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/ac41161569ce4a44b3b11f5d5f9287cf.mp4?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEAD THE VILLAGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elect a new leader to coordinate the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a jail, construct a gallows, and make decisions that may save or doom your fellow villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/6a0e9ef6df13ef574263eb5ef4b36ba6.poster.avif?t=1783425363\" width=1080 height=566 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/6a0e9ef6df13ef574263eb5ef4b36ba6.webm?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/6a0e9ef6df13ef574263eb5ef4b36ba6.mp4?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EMBRACE THE CURSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Werewolf, deceive the villagers during the day and hunt your victims at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special abilities, sabotage the village, and spread chaos before your identity is revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/f026205cd82f8e26d7f9b0cfbe3cdeb1.poster.avif?t=1783425363\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/f026205cd82f8e26d7f9b0cfbe3cdeb1.webm?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/f026205cd82f8e26d7f9b0cfbe3cdeb1.mp4?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE UNTIL DAY SIX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, complete your duties, and find a way to escape through the mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or uncover the Werewolf and eliminate the threat before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Online multiplayer social deduction gameplay (up to 8 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• One player secretly takes on the role of the Werewolf</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 4 professions with unique abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Leadership, trials, and execution systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Sabotage, fires, and dynamic events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Potion crafting and alchemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Proximity voice chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 6-day and night cycle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Multiple victory conditions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Horror, cooperation, and survival</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WEREWOLF - THE VILLAGE is a multiplayer social deduction horror game where a group of adventurers must help a struggling village survive while trying to uncover which one of them is a Werewolf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work for the community during the day, survive the night, and discover who is hiding the curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PROFESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a Lumberjack, Miner, Hunter, or Herbalist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class has unique tasks, abilities, and responsibilities. The village's survival depends on everyone's cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/5ddb4d86d51afa690bc8a06bf4049638.poster.avif?t=1783425363\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/5ddb4d86d51afa690bc8a06bf4049638.webm?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/5ddb4d86d51afa690bc8a06bf4049638.mp4?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEEP THE VILLAGE ALIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, deliver supplies, and prevent the community from collapsing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shortage of food, coal, wood, or herbs will affect every player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/20d564c46bd3f4ee876cb910792e67a4.poster.avif?t=1783425363\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/20d564c46bd3f4ee876cb910792e67a4.webm?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/20d564c46bd3f4ee876cb910792e67a4.mp4?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNMASK THE WEREWOLF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the Mayor's death, the villagers must find the one responsible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attend meetings, accuse suspects, and survive long enough to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/ac41161569ce4a44b3b11f5d5f9287cf.poster.avif?t=1783425363\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/ac41161569ce4a44b3b11f5d5f9287cf.webm?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/ac41161569ce4a44b3b11f5d5f9287cf.mp4?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEAD THE VILLAGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elect a new leader to coordinate the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a jail, construct a gallows, and make decisions that may save or doom your fellow villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/6a0e9ef6df13ef574263eb5ef4b36ba6.poster.avif?t=1783425363\" width=1080 height=566 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/6a0e9ef6df13ef574263eb5ef4b36ba6.webm?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/6a0e9ef6df13ef574263eb5ef4b36ba6.mp4?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EMBRACE THE CURSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Werewolf, deceive the villagers during the day and hunt your victims at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special abilities, sabotage the village, and spread chaos before your identity is revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/f026205cd82f8e26d7f9b0cfbe3cdeb1.poster.avif?t=1783425363\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/f026205cd82f8e26d7f9b0cfbe3cdeb1.webm?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/extras/f026205cd82f8e26d7f9b0cfbe3cdeb1.mp4?t=1783425363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE UNTIL DAY SIX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, complete your duties, and find a way to escape through the mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or uncover the Werewolf and eliminate the threat before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Online multiplayer social deduction gameplay (up to 8 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• One player secretly takes on the role of the Werewolf</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 4 professions with unique abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Leadership, trials, and execution systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Sabotage, fires, and dynamic events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Potion crafting and alchemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Proximity voice chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 6-day and night cycle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Multiple victory conditions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Horror, cooperation, and survival</p>", "short_description": "Build trust by day. Destroy friendships by night. WEREWOLF THE VILLAGE is a horror social deduction game where a Werewolf hides among the villagers. Keep the village alive, take part in trials, and uncover whether the monster is in the forest or beside you.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/48200609f26400b674476b1460ba37a1130e0d9d/header.jpg?t=1783425363", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/3ab8bc0e887febaf04e974fb3d1fc9e02c5c31d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783425363", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792470/3ab8bc0e887febaf04e974fb3d1fc9e02c5c31d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783425363", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u